{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 4958062,
  "courseSlug": "remix-course",
  "courseTitle": "Remix.js - The Practical Guide",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "34674450",
      "title": "Surfacing Component Styles",
      "lectureOrder": 17,
      "videoOrder": 13,
      "sourceHash": "955a9ce1a3044390244637171128d4c6837a7e582f81ebbc63011506f49125a1",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.07,
          "end": 3.45,
          "en": "Now when it comes to styling",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.45,
          "end": 5.76,
          "en": "there's one last aspect of styling",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.76,
          "end": 9.48,
          "en": "which I wanna show you and which I wanna talk about.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.48,
          "end": 11.79,
          "en": "Let's say on this notes page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 11.79,
          "end": 15.24,
          "en": "we finally want to add more meaningful content.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 15.24,
          "end": 18.18,
          "en": "For that attached you find a React component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 18.18,
          "end": 21.87,
          "en": "a component which will not use as a Route, as a page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 21.87,
          "end": 23.94,
          "en": "but as a regular component that we use",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 23.94,
          "end": 26.16,
          "en": "as part of our components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 26.16,
          "end": 28.02,
          "en": "To be precise, the attached component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 28.02,
          "end": 30.963,
          "en": "should be used here in this notes page component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 32.04,
          "end": 36,
          "en": "For that attached, you find a NewNote.jsx file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 36,
          "end": 38.343,
          "en": "and a NewNote.css file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 39.27,
          "end": 40.62,
          "en": "Now I'll add a new folder",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 40.62,
          "end": 42.69,
          "en": "in my app folder called components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 42.69,
          "end": 44.88,
          "en": "Though this name is also up to you.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 44.88,
          "end": 46.77,
          "en": "It doesn't have to be components,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 46.77,
          "end": 48.45,
          "en": "it could be any name of your choice.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 48.45,
          "end": 50.76,
          "en": "Remix will not be looking for it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 50.76,
          "end": 52.74,
          "en": "But it makes sense to name it components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 52.74,
          "end": 55.56,
          "en": "because I'll store all my non page components,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 55.56,
          "end": 58.92,
          "en": "all my non page React components in there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 58.92,
          "end": 63.78,
          "en": "So the attached NewNote.jsx file and css files go in there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 63.78,
          "end": 66.3,
          "en": "Now if you take a look at this NewNote component file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 66.3,
          "end": 68.19,
          "en": "you'll see that in there we got a form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 68.19,
          "end": 71.82,
          "en": "This form will become important later for adding new notes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 71.82,
          "end": 73.56,
          "en": "At the moment, we can ignore the content",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 73.56,
          "end": 75.75,
          "en": "and as you see it's also not too exciting.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 75.75,
          "end": 78.6,
          "en": "It's really just that form with some inputs.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 78.6,
          "end": 81.783,
          "en": "And then we got some styles for this form and the inputs.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 82.65,
          "end": 84.84,
          "en": "Now I wanna use this new note component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 84.84,
          "end": 87.36,
          "en": "in this notes.jsx file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 87.36,
          "end": 91.38,
          "en": "And there it should be used instead of this H one element.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 91.38,
          "end": 94.35,
          "en": "To do that, we first of all have to import",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 94.35,
          "end": 98.37,
          "en": "this newly added component into this notes.jsx file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 98.37,
          "end": 100.036,
          "en": "So we import NewNote from",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 100.036,
          "end": 103.41,
          "en": "and then we can use the tilde symbol to get our",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 103.41,
          "end": 105.69,
          "en": "quick access to the app folder.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 105.69,
          "end": 108.87,
          "en": "And then access /components/NewNote.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 108.87,
          "end": 110.47,
          "en": "You can omit the file extension.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 111.50999999999999,
          "end": 114.72,
          "en": "And then here we can use NewNote as a component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 114.72,
          "end": 117.50999999999999,
          "en": "like we do it in any other React app as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 117.50999999999999,
          "end": 120.63,
          "en": "There's nothing Remix specific about this code here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 120.63,
          "end": 122.46,
          "en": "It's a standard React component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 122.46,
          "end": 125.193,
          "en": "using another React component, which is imported.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 126.75,
          "end": 128.19,
          "en": "Now if you save that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 128.19,
          "end": 129.96,
          "en": "you'll notice that the form is visible",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 129.96,
          "end": 133.443,
          "en": "but of course not styled, not looking good.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 134.4,
          "end": 136.38,
          "en": "Now to apply that styling here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 136.38,
          "end": 139.82999999999998,
          "en": "we have to expose this style file via links.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 139.82999999999998,
          "end": 142.74,
          "en": "Now for doing that, we got a couple of options.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 142.74,
          "end": 147.36,
          "en": "We can go to our notes.jsx file to this Route file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 147.36,
          "end": 150.21,
          "en": "And for example, not just import the NewNote component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 150.21,
          "end": 152.64,
          "en": "from the NewNote.jsx file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 152.64,
          "end": 154.71,
          "en": "but also the import the newNoteStyles",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 154.71,
          "end": 159.24,
          "en": "from /components/NewNote.css.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 159.24,
          "end": 161.19,
          "en": "And here you need the file extension.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 161.19,
          "end": 163.5,
          "en": "You do need it for .css files.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 163.5,
          "end": 166.893,
          "en": "You can only omit it for JavaScript and jsx files.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 168.75,
          "end": 171.09,
          "en": "Now with that imported, we can of course export",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 171.09,
          "end": 174.09,
          "en": "this links function as we did before,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 174.09,
          "end": 175.65,
          "en": "return that array,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 175.65,
          "end": 180.65,
          "en": "and make our style sheet available here like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 181.02,
          "end": 185.31,
          "en": "That's what we did before, and if we do that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 185.31,
          "end": 186.78,
          "en": "we got the styling applied.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 186.78,
          "end": 190.367,
          "en": "So that works and that is a perfectly fine way of doing it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 190.367,
          "end": 193.41,
          "en": "Now there is an alternative approach though,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 193.41,
          "end": 197.25,
          "en": "so that you don't have to add this extra css import here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 197.25,
          "end": 199.473,
          "en": "in your Route component file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 200.37,
          "end": 203.01,
          "en": "We could go to the NewNote.jsx file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 203.01,
          "end": 207.48,
          "en": "and we could import this styles file from here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 207.48,
          "end": 210.09,
          "en": "Now of course we still import the NewNote.css",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 210.09,
          "end": 213.03,
          "en": "file in the end, but it might make more sense to do it here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 213.03,
          "end": 214.82999999999998,
          "en": "in the NewNote.jsx file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 214.82999999999998,
          "end": 217.383,
          "en": "which sits next to the css file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 218.22,
          "end": 220.62,
          "en": "With those styles imported here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 220.62,
          "end": 225.03,
          "en": "we could then export them from this NewNote.jsx file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 225.03,
          "end": 227.34,
          "en": "To be precise we could export",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 227.34,
          "end": 230.19,
          "en": "a links function here as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 230.19,
          "end": 231.93,
          "en": "And that function has the same shape",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 231.93,
          "end": 236.59300000000002,
          "en": "as it does in my Route files, sorry, add rel: stylesheet,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 238.29,
          "end": 240.273,
          "en": "and then href: styles.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 241.47,
          "end": 244.86,
          "en": "Styles is the name I chose here for the import.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 244.86,
          "end": 247.473,
          "en": "So I added this links function to this component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 248.46,
          "end": 251.58,
          "en": "Now the problem is Remix will not be looking for",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 251.58,
          "end": 253.8,
          "en": "links functions or any other",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 253.8,
          "end": 255.72,
          "en": "Route component specific functions",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 255.72,
          "end": 258.15,
          "en": "in files that are not Route files.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 258.15,
          "end": 260.19,
          "en": "And since this is a regular component file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 260.19,
          "end": 261.75,
          "en": "not in the Route folder,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 261.75,
          "end": 264.9,
          "en": "Remix will ignore this link's function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 264.9,
          "end": 266.94,
          "en": "But of course we can use it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 266.94,
          "end": 269.28,
          "en": "In this notes.jsx file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 269.28,
          "end": 272.04,
          "en": "we can add more than just the NewNote component function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 272.04,
          "end": 274.35,
          "en": "from the NewNote.jsx file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 274.35,
          "end": 277.95,
          "en": "We can also import this link's function, which we export.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 277.95,
          "end": 281.287,
          "en": "And we could give it an alias, maybe newNoteLinks.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 283.26,
          "end": 285.06,
          "en": "And now here in the links which we return",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 285.06,
          "end": 290.06,
          "en": "for the notes page, we could simply merge in all links",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 291.54,
          "end": 294.9,
          "en": "of any components that we might be using.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 294.9,
          "end": 297.09000000000003,
          "en": "So we execute new note links here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 297.09000000000003,
          "end": 299.97,
          "en": "this function which we're importing from NewNote,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 299.97,
          "end": 302.7,
          "en": "and this function returns an array.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 302.7,
          "end": 305.7,
          "en": "And then I use the spread operator to merge the array items",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 305.7,
          "end": 308.19,
          "en": "into this array returned by this links function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 308.19,
          "end": 310.14,
          "en": "in this route component file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 310.14,
          "end": 312.99,
          "en": "This is a pattern called surfacing links,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 312.99,
          "end": 314.25,
          "en": "and it is actually a pattern",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 314.25,
          "end": 315.81,
          "en": "that's also mentioned and explained",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 315.81,
          "end": 318.24,
          "en": "in the official Remix documentation,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 318.24,
          "end": 320.52,
          "en": "which is why I'm also mentioning it here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 320.52,
          "end": 322.32,
          "en": "It is some extra work, but it makes sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 322.32,
          "end": 325.29,
          "en": "that you can use one consistent API for making",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 325.29,
          "end": 327.42,
          "en": "your style files available.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 327.42,
          "end": 329.04,
          "en": "One thing I wanna mention though,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 329.04,
          "end": 332.25,
          "en": "which is really important is that those styles",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 332.25,
          "end": 334.44,
          "en": "defined in this NewNote.css file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 334.44,
          "end": 337.29,
          "en": "will not be scoped to this component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 337.29,
          "end": 339.84000000000003,
          "en": "They are still global styles.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 339.84000000000003,
          "end": 342.99,
          "en": "If you are defining some class in here, like form-actions",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 342.99,
          "end": 345.3,
          "en": "which I am, and you're using that class",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 345.3,
          "end": 348.33,
          "en": "in some other component that's part of that same page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 348.33,
          "end": 350.7,
          "en": "as well, those styles would be applied",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 350.7,
          "end": 353.58,
          "en": "and would potentially clash with other styles.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 353.58,
          "end": 355.92,
          "en": "We're not using CSS Modules here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 355.92,
          "end": 358.05,
          "en": "We've got no scope styles,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 358.05,
          "end": 360.57,
          "en": "so we have some component specific styles",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 360.57,
          "end": 363.54,
          "en": "kind of, but they're technically still global.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 363.54,
          "end": 367.11,
          "en": "It still makes sense to manage them in a separate css file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 367.11,
          "end": 369.69,
          "en": "which might be kept close to the jsx file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 369.69,
          "end": 371.52,
          "en": "so that maintaining this component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 371.52,
          "end": 374.61,
          "en": "and it's styles is as easy as possible.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 374.61,
          "end": 376.44,
          "en": "Ultimately, it is of course up to you",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 376.44,
          "end": 378.06,
